#: Application/Commands/Playback/SelectionSaving.cs:157
msgid "Some selections could not be saved. Check the details below."
msgstr ""
"No se pudieron guardar algunas selecciones. Consulta los detalles a "
"continuación."

#. Translators: Shown when the sleep timer is set to stop at the end of the current track but
#. nothing is playing.
