#. Translators: Title of the window containing Luna Player's version and website.
#: UI/Dialogs/AboutDialog.cs:17
msgid "About Luna Player"
msgstr "Acerca de Luna Player"

#. Translators: Description in the Luna Player About window.
#: UI/Dialogs/AboutDialog.cs:23
msgid ""
"Luna Player is a fast, accessible media player for Windows. It is designed "
"for effortless keyboard control and a clear screen-reader experience, and "
"plays local media, network streams, and YouTube content without getting in "
"your way."
msgstr ""
"Luna Player es un reproductor multimedia rápido y accesible para Windows. "
"Está diseñado para controlarse fácilmente mediante el teclado y ofrecer una "
