#. Translators: F1 help for the Spotify account or quality controls in Preferences.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:16
msgid ""
"Enter the Client ID from your own Spotify developer app for Home, Search and "
"Library. Register the redirect URI shown below. Playback signs in "
"separately. A client secret is not needed."
msgstr ""
"Introduce el ID de cliente de tu propia aplicación de desarrollador de "
"Spotify para Inicio, Buscar y Biblioteca. Registra la URI de redirección que "
"se muestra a continuación. La reproducción inicia sesión por separado. No se "
"necesita un secreto de cliente."

#. Translators: Label for the public application identifier in Spotify Preferences; keep Client ID unchanged.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:23
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "ID de cliente"

#. Translators: Normal quality option in Spotify Preferences. Preserve the bitrate and unit.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:29
msgid "Normal (96 kbps)"
msgstr "Normal (96 kbps)"

#. Translators: High quality option in Spotify Preferences. Preserve the bitrate and unit.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:31
msgid "High (160 kbps)"
msgstr "Alta (160 kbps)"

#. Translators: Highest quality option in Spotify Preferences. Preserve the bitrate and unit.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:33
msgid "Very high (320 kbps)"
msgstr "Muy alta (320 kbps)"

#. Translators: Heading above developer application setup instructions in Spotify Preferences.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:36
msgid "How to get a Spotify Client ID"
msgstr "Cómo obtener un ID de cliente de Spotify"

#. Translators: First setup step in Spotify Preferences. {url} is the developer dashboard address.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:40
msgid "1. Open {url} and sign in."
msgstr "1. Abre {url} e inicia sesión."

#. Translators: Step in the setup instructions in Spotify Preferences. Keep URLs, Client ID, Redirect URI and Web API unchanged.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:42
msgid "2. Choose Create app. Enter a name and select Web API."
msgstr "2. Elige Crear aplicación. Introduce un nombre y selecciona API web."

#. Translators: Step in the setup instructions in Spotify Preferences. Keep URLs, Client ID, Redirect URI and Web API unchanged.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:44
msgid "3. Add this Redirect URI in the app settings:"
msgstr "3. Añade esta URI de redirección en la configuración de la aplicación:"

#. Translators: Step in the setup instructions in Spotify Preferences. Keep URLs, Client ID, Redirect URI and Web API unchanged.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:47
msgid "4. Save the app. Copy its Client ID and paste it in the box above."
msgstr ""
"4. Guarda la aplicación. Copia su ID de cliente y pégalo en el cuadro de "
"arriba."

#. Translators: Account setup guidance in Spotify Preferences. Keep Spotify, Client ID, Client Secret and PKCE unchanged.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:49
msgid "You do not need the Client Secret."
msgstr "No necesitas el secreto de cliente."

#. Translators: Account setup guidance in Spotify Preferences. Keep Spotify, Client ID, Client Secret and PKCE unchanged.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:51
msgid ""
"Web API is required for Home, Search and Library. Spotify audio playback "
"signs in separately."
msgstr ""
"Se requiere la API web para Inicio, Buscar y Biblioteca. La reproducción de "
"audio de Spotify inicia sesión por separado."

#. Translators: Account setup guidance in Spotify Preferences. Keep Spotify, Client ID, Client Secret and PKCE unchanged.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:57
msgid ""
"Spotify uses Authorization Code with PKCE. Never enter a client secret here."
msgstr ""
"Spotify utiliza el Código de autorización con PKCE. Nunca introduzcas un "
"secreto de cliente aquí."

#. Translators: F1 help for the Client ID text field on the Spotify Preferences page.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:69
msgid ""
"Paste the Client ID of your Spotify developer app. This public ID identifies "
"your app when you sign in."
msgstr ""
"Pega el ID de cliente de tu aplicación de desarrollador de Spotify. Este ID "
"público identifica tu aplicación al iniciar sesión."

#. Translators: F1 help for the read-only developer-app setup instructions on the Spotify Preferences page.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:71
msgid ""
"Follow these steps in the Spotify developer dashboard. The redirect URI must "
"match exactly."
msgstr ""
"Sigue estos pasos en el panel de desarrolladores de Spotify. La URI de "
"redirección debe coincidir exactamente."

#. Translators: F1 help for the audio-quality selector on the Spotify Preferences page; the three numbers are stream bitrates.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:73
msgid ""
"Select the Spotify stream quality: Normal 96 kbps, High 160 kbps, or Very "
"high 320 kbps. Changing this while a track plays restarts that track at its "
"current position."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona la calidad de transmisión de Spotify: Normal de 96 kbps, Alta de "
"160 kbps o Muy alta de 320 kbps. Cambiar esto mientras se reproduce una "
"pista la reiniciará en su posición actual."

#. Translators: Validation error for the Client ID field in Spotify Preferences.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPreferences.cs:81
msgid ""
"The Spotify Client ID must be empty or exactly 32 hexadecimal characters."
msgstr ""
"El ID de cliente de Spotify debe estar vacío o tener exactamente 32 "
"caracteres hexadecimales."

#. Translators: Message in the Spotify credentials prompt before opening Preferences.
#: UI/Spotify/CredentialsPrompt.cs:16
msgid ""
"Spotify credentials have not been configured. Would you like to go to "
"Preferences to configure them?"
msgstr ""
"Las credenciales de Spotify no se han configurado. ¿Te gustaría ir a "
"Preferencias para configurarlas?"

