msgstr "Añadir a la cola"

#. Translators: Shown when OK is pressed in the download window with no folder chosen.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadDialog.cs:169
msgid "Choose a folder to download into."
msgstr "Elige una carpeta donde descargar."

#. Translators: Title of the window that picks the folder a download is saved into.
#. Translators: Title of the window that picks the folder YouTube downloads are saved into.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadDialog.cs:202 UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:214
msgid "Select the download folder"
msgstr "Seleccionar la carpeta de descarga"

#. Translators: Title of the warning shown when Luna is closed while downloads remain unfinished.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadExitDialog.cs:13
msgid "Downloads still in progress"
msgstr "Descargas todavía en curso"

#: UI/YouTube/DownloadExitDialog.cs:16
msgid ""
"There are items still downloading in the download queue. Closing Luna will "
"cancel them."
msgstr ""
"Hay elementos descargándose todavía en la cola. Cerrar Luna los cancelará."

#. Translators: Confirms closing Luna even though download queue work remains unfinished.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadExitDialog.cs:20
msgid "Close anyway"
msgstr "Cerrar de todos modos"

#. Translators: Tick box on the YouTube download settings page: sort files into video and audio subfolders.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:69
msgid "Sort downloads by type"
msgstr "Clasificar descargas por tipo"

#. Translators: Heading of the radio group that chooses whether a YouTube download saves video or audio by default.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:71
msgid "Default download type"
msgstr "Tipo de descarga predeterminado"

#. Translators: Audio format offered on the YouTube download settings page. "MP3" is a format name.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:96
msgid "MP3"
msgstr "MP3"

#. Translators: Audio format offered on the YouTube download settings page. "M4A" is a format name.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:98
msgid "M4A"
msgstr "M4A"

#. Translators: Audio format offered on the YouTube download settings page. "Opus" is a format name.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:100
msgid "Opus"
msgstr "Opus"

#. Translators: Audio format offered on the YouTube download settings page. "FLAC" is a format name.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:102
msgid "FLAC"
msgstr "FLAC"

#. Translators: Audio format offered on the YouTube download settings page. "WAV" is a format name.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:104
msgid "WAV"
msgstr "WAV"

#. Translators: Heading of the group of less-used YouTube download options.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:115
msgid "Advanced options"
msgstr "Opciones avanzadas"

#. Translators: Label of the box holding how many YouTube videos the download queue may fetch at once.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:120
msgid "Simultaneous downloads"
msgstr "Descargas simultáneas"

#. Translators: Help text for the box holding the folder YouTube downloads are saved into.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:162
msgid ""
"The base folder downloads are saved into. When empty, a Luna Player folder "
"in your Downloads is used."
msgstr ""
"La carpeta base en la que se guardan las descargas. Si está vacía, se "
"utiliza una carpeta de Luna Player en tus Descargas."

#. Translators: Help text for the button that picks the YouTube download folder.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:165
msgid "Opens a folder picker to choose where downloads are saved."
msgstr ""
"Abre un selector de carpetas para elegir dónde se guardan las descargas."

#. Translators: Help text for the tick box that sorts YouTube downloads into video and audio subfolders.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:168
msgid ""
"When checked, downloads are sorted into 'videos' and 'audios' subfolders. "
"When unchecked, they are saved straight into the download folder."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcado, las descargas se clasifican en las subcarpetas 'videos' "
"y \"audios'. Cuando no está marcado, se guardan directamente en la carpeta "
"de descargas."

#. Translators: Help text for the control that chooses whether a YouTube download saves video or audio.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:171
msgid ""
"Whether a direct download saves the video or its sound alone. The normal "
"download dialog opens on this choice and lets you change it per download."
msgstr ""
"Indica si una descarga directa guarda el video o solo su sonido. El cuadro "
"de diálogo de descarga normal se abre en esta opción y te permite cambiarla "
"por cada descarga."

#. Translators: Help text for the list that chooses the picture quality of downloaded YouTube videos.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:174
msgid ""
"The picture height a video download is capped at. yt-dlp saves the best "
"quality at or below it."
msgstr ""
"La altura de imagen máxima a la que se limita la descarga de un video. yt-"
"dlp guarda la mejor calidad disponible en esa altura o por debajo de ella."

#. Translators: Help text for the list that chooses a downloaded YouTube video's file type. "MP4" and "MKV" are format names.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:177
msgid ""
"The file type a downloaded video is saved as. MP4 plays almost everywhere; "
"MKV holds more but is less widely supported."
msgstr ""
"El tipo de archivo como el que se guarda un video descargado. MP4 se "
"reproduce en casi todas partes; MKV admite más contenido pero tiene menos "
"compatibilidad."

#. Translators: Help text for the list that chooses a downloaded YouTube audio track's file type.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:180
msgid ""
"The file type a downloaded audio track is converted to. MP3 plays almost "
"everywhere; FLAC and WAV are lossless and larger."
msgstr ""
"El tipo de archivo al que se convierte una pista de audio descargada. MP3 se "
"reproduce en casi todas partes; FLAC y WAV son sin pérdida de calidad y "
"ocupan más espacio."

#. Translators: Help text for the list that chooses a downloaded YouTube audio track's bitrate.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:183
msgid ""
"The bitrate a downloaded audio track is converted at. It has no effect on "
"the lossless formats."
msgstr ""
"La velocidad de bits (bitrate) a la que se convierte una pista de audio "
"descargada. No tiene ningún efecto en los formatos sin pérdida."

#. Translators: Help text for the box holding how many pieces of a YouTube file are fetched at once.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:186
msgid ""
"How many pieces of a file yt-dlp fetches at once, from 1 through 16. More "
"can be faster on a fast connection; one is gentlest."
msgstr ""
"Cuántas partes de un archivo obtiene yt-dlp a la vez, entre 1 y 16. Un "
"número mayor puede ser más rápido en una conexión rápida; una sola parte es "
"la opción más estable."

#. Translators: Help text for the box holding how many YouTube videos the download queue may fetch at once.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:189
msgid ""
"How many videos the download queue may download at the same time, from 1 "
"through 16."
msgstr "Videos para descargar en cola al mismo tiempo, de 1 a 16."

#. Translators: Help text for the tick box that writes details into a downloaded YouTube file.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:192
msgid ""
"When checked, the title, uploader and other details are written into the "
"downloaded file."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcado, el título, el creador y otros detalles se escriben "
"dentro del archivo descargado."

#. Translators: Help text for the tick box that embeds a YouTube thumbnail as cover art.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:195
msgid ""
"When checked, the video's thumbnail is embedded as cover art in the "
"downloaded file."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcado, la miniatura del video se incrusta como portada en el "
"archivo descargado."

#. Translators: Help text for the tick box that writes chapter marks into a downloaded YouTube file.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:198
msgid ""
"When checked, the video's chapter marks are written into the downloaded "
"file, where the format supports them."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcado, las marcas de capítulo del video se escriben en el "
"archivo descargado, siempre que el formato sea compatible."

#. Translators: Help text for the tick box that embeds subtitles into a downloaded YouTube file.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:201
msgid ""
"When checked, the video's available subtitles are embedded into the "
"downloaded file."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcado, los subtítulos disponibles del video se incrustan en el "
"archivo descargado."

#. Translators: Help text for the tick box that removes SponsorBlock segments from a YouTube download. "SponsorBlock" is a service name.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadPreferences.cs:204
msgid ""
"When checked, SponsorBlock data is used to cut sponsor reads, intros and "
"similar segments out of the download."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcado, se utilizan los datos de SponsorBlock para recortar "
"patrocinadores, intros y segmentos similares de la descarga."

#. Translators: Title of the window showing progress for one YouTube download.
#. Translators: Title of the progress window while a YouTube file is downloading.
#. Translators: Status of a queue item while it is downloading.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:38
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:138
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:319
msgid "Downloading"
msgstr "Descargando"

#. Translators: Shown in the download window before the first progress has arrived.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:46
msgid "Preparing to download…"
msgstr "Preparando para descargar…"

#. Translators: Hides this progress window while leaving its download visible in the queue.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:54
msgid "Minimize to queue"
msgstr "Minimizar a la cola"

#. Translators: Shown for the total download size before yt-dlp reports it.
#. Translators: Stands in for a version number that could not be read.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:142 YouTube/Components/Service.cs:274
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "desconocido"

#. Translators: Download speed. {size} is a file size and "/s" means per second.
#. Translators: Combined queue speed. {size} is a file size and "/s" means per second.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:145
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:288
msgid "{size}/s"
msgstr "{size}/s"

#. Translators: How much of the file has downloaded. {done} and {total} are sizes such as "4.2 MB".
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:154
msgid "Downloaded: {done} of {total}"
msgstr "Descargado: {done} de {total}"

#. Translators: The current download speed. {speed} is a size per second such as "1.3 MB/s".
#. Translators: Combined download speed of all active queue items.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:160
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:304
msgid "Speed: {speed}"
msgstr "Velocidad: {speed}"

#. Translators: A download has finished conversion and is being finalized.
#. Translators: yt-dlp is moving the finished file to its destination.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:170
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:188
msgid "Finishing…"
msgstr "Finalizando…"

#. Translators: yt-dlp is joining the downloaded audio and video streams.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:173
msgid "Merging video and audio…"
msgstr "Fusionando vídeo y audio…"

#. Translators: yt-dlp/ffmpeg is converting the download to the chosen format.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:178
msgid "Converting…"
msgstr "Convirtiendo…"

#. Translators: yt-dlp is embedding metadata, artwork, subtitles, or chapters.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:181
msgid "Embedding information…"
msgstr "Incrustando información…"

#. Translators: yt-dlp is modifying chapters or removing sponsored sections.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:185
msgid "Processing chapters…"
msgstr "Procesando capítulos…"

#. Translators: Generic state while yt-dlp performs a finishing operation after downloading.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:190
msgid "Post-processing…"
msgstr "Postprocesamiento…"

#. Translators: Asks the user to confirm stopping a download that is still running.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadProgressDialog.cs:207
msgid "The download is still running. Would you like to stop it?"
msgstr "La descarga aún está en ejecución. ¿Quieres detenerla?"

#. Translators: Title of the window listing queued YouTube downloads.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:41
msgid "Download queue"
msgstr "Cola de descargas"

#. Translators: Second column in the download queue, holding states such as In queue or Downloading.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:50
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Estado"

#. Translators: Stops every active download and returns it to the queue.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:65
msgid "Stop all"
msgstr "Detener todo"

#. Translators: Confirmation shown before an item is removed from the download queue.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:232
msgid "Remove the selected video from the download queue?"
msgstr "¿Eliminar el vídeo seleccionado de la cola de descargas?"

#. Translators: Title of the prompt confirming removal from the download queue.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:234
msgid "Remove download"
msgstr "Eliminar descarga"

#. Translators: Queue status after every item has finished successfully.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:270
msgid "All downloads are complete."
msgstr "Todas las descargas se han completado."

#. Translators: Queue status when no download is running and unfinished items are waiting.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:277
msgid "Ready to download."
msgstr "Listo para descargar."

#. Translators: Technical reason supplied by yt-dlp for a failed queue item.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:281 UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:312
msgid "Error: {details}"
msgstr "Error: {details}"

#. Translators: Queue progress. {current} and {total} are video counts; {percent} is a whole number.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:299
msgid "Downloading video {current} of {total}, {percent}%"
msgstr "Descargando vídeo {current} de {total}, {percent}%"

#. Translators: Status after media bytes are downloaded but finishing work may remain.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:321
msgid "Downloaded"
msgstr "Descargado"

#. Translators: Status of a queue item that finished successfully.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:323
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "Completado"

#. Translators: Status of a queue item whose download failed.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:325
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "Fallido"

#. Translators: Status of a queue item waiting to start.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:327
msgid "In queue"
msgstr "En cola"

#. Translators: Title of the window used to add YouTube links to the download queue.
#. Translators: Title of a warning shown in the queue link-entry window.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:369 UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:421
msgid "Add links to download queue"
msgstr "Añadir enlaces a la cola de descargas"

#. Translators: Label above the multi-line box used to add links to the download queue.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:372
msgid "Enter one YouTube video link on each line."
msgstr "Introduce un enlace de vídeo de YouTube por línea."

#. Translators: Shown when Add is pressed without entering any links.
#: UI/YouTube/DownloadQueueDialog.cs:419
msgid "Enter at least one YouTube video link."
msgstr "Introduce al menos un enlace de vídeo de YouTube."

#. Translators: Label of the box holding the address a saved link points at.
#. Translators: Heading of the favourites list column holding the address of each saved link.
#: UI/YouTube/FavoriteEditDialog.cs:35 UI/YouTube/FavoritesDialog.cs:33
msgid "Link"
msgstr "Enlace"

#. Translators: Label of the box holding how many videos a search should look for.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:67
msgid "Number of search results"
msgstr "Número de resultados de búsqueda"

#. Translators: Tick box on the YouTube settings page: offer search suggestions as the user types.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:70
msgid "Show search suggestions while typing"
msgstr "Mostrar sugerencias de búsqueda al escribir"

#. Translators: Label of the list that chooses what to do with a link naming a video and a playlist at once.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:72
msgid "Video+playlist link behavior"
msgstr "Comportamiento al abrir enlaces de video+lista de reproducción"

#. Translators: One of the choices for a link naming both: ask which was meant, every time.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:75
msgid "Ask every time"
msgstr "Preguntar siempre"

#. Translators: One of the choices for a link naming both: always play the single video.
#. Translators: Button that plays the one video a link names, rather than the playlist it also names.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:77 UI/YouTube/LinkKindDialog.cs:28
msgid "Play the video"
msgstr "Reproducir el video"

#. Translators: One of the choices for a link naming both: always open the whole playlist.
#. Translators: Button that lists every video in the playlist a link names, rather than the one video.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:79 UI/YouTube/LinkKindDialog.cs:31
msgid "Open the playlist"
msgstr "Abrir la lista de reproducción"

#. Translators: Heading of the group of settings that give YouTube the browser cookies it may need.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:85
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Cookies"

#. Translators: Label of the box showing the cookie file yt-dlp will use, if one was chosen.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:87
msgid "Cookie file"
msgstr "Archivo de cookies"

#. Translators: Button that switches Luna to reading cookies straight from Firefox each time, with no file.
#. "Firefox" is a program name and is not translated.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:94
msgid "Import from Firefox"
msgstr "Importar desde Firefox"

#. Translators: Label of the read-only box that says which cookie source is in use.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:99
msgid "Cookie status"
msgstr "Estado de las cookies"

#. Translators: Label of the list that chooses which line of yt-dlp releases to follow. "yt-dlp" is a
#. program name and is not translated.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:120
msgid "yt-dlp update channel"
msgstr "Canal de actualización de yt-dlp"

#. Translators: One of the yt-dlp release lines: the tested one.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:123
msgid "Stable"
msgstr "Estable"

#. Translators: One of the yt-dlp release lines: rebuilt every night.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:125
msgid "Nightly"
msgstr "Nightly"

#. Translators: One of the yt-dlp release lines: rebuilt from the latest source.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:127
msgid "Master"
msgstr "Master"

#. Translators: Tick box on the YouTube settings page: look for a newer yt-dlp each time the player starts.
#. "yt-dlp" is a program name and is not translated.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:130
msgid "Check for yt-dlp updates on startup"
msgstr "Buscar actualizaciones de yt-dlp al iniciar"

#. Translators: Button on the YouTube settings page that fetches the extra programs YouTube downloads need.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:132
msgid "Download YouTube components"
msgstr "Descargar componentes de YouTube"

#. Translators: Help text for the list that chooses the picture quality a video is played at.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:149
msgid ""
"Sets the picture height Luna asks for when you play a video with Enter. A "
"lower height starts sooner and uses less network; Luna falls back to the "
"closest the video offers."
msgstr ""
"Define la altura de la imagen que Luna solicita cuando reproduces un vídeo "
"con Enter. Una altura menor inicia antes y usa menos red; Luna recurrirá a "
"la opción disponible más cercana en el vídeo."

#. Translators: Help text for the list that chooses the sound quality a video's audio is played at.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:152
msgid ""
"Sets the bitrate Luna asks for when you play a video's sound alone with "
"Ctrl+Enter. Luna falls back to the closest the video offers."
msgstr ""
"Define la tasa de bits que Luna solicita cuando reproduces solo el sonido de "
"un vídeo con Ctrl+Enter. Luna recurrirá a la opción disponible más cercana "
"en el vídeo."

#. Translators: Help text for the box holding how many videos a search should look for. The two numbers are
#. the smallest and largest it accepts.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:156
msgid ""
"Sets the size of the first result page, from 5 through 100 videos. Larger "
"pages take longer to fetch; reaching the end still loads more results."
msgstr ""
"Establece el tamaño de la primera página de resultados, de 5 a 100 videos. "
"Las páginas más grandes tardan más en obtenerse; llegar al final sigue "
"cargando más resultados."

#. Translators: Help text for the tick box that offers search suggestions while typing.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:159
msgid ""
"When checked, a list of completions is offered as you type, fetched from "
"YouTube. When unchecked, no completions are fetched and typing makes no "
"background network requests."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcado, se ofrece una lista de sugerencias de autocompletado "
"mientras escribes, obtenida de YouTube. Cuando no está marcado, no se "
"obtienen sugerencias y al escribir no se realizan solicitudes de red en "
"segundo plano."

#. Translators: Help text for the list that chooses what to do with a link naming a video and a playlist at once.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:162
msgid ""
"For an address containing both a video and a playlist, Luna can ask each "
"time, open only that video, or list the complete playlist."
msgstr ""
"Para una dirección que contiene tanto un video como una lista de "
"reproducción, Luna puede preguntar cada vez, abrir solo ese video o listar "
"la lista de reproducción completa."

#. Translators: Help text for the list that chooses which line of yt-dlp releases to follow. "yt-dlp" is a program name and is not translated.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:165
msgid ""
"Stable changes least often and is intended for normal use. Nightly is "
"rebuilt each night. Master follows the newest source and may be unreliable."
msgstr ""
"Estable cambia con menos frecuencia y está destinada al uso normal. Nightly "
"se recompila cada noche. Master sigue el código fuente más reciente y puede "
"ser inestable."

#. Translators: Help text for the tick box that looks for a newer yt-dlp at startup. "yt-dlp" is a program
#. name and is not translated.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:169
msgid ""
"When checked, Luna looks for a newer yt-dlp when it starts and offers to "
"download it. When unchecked, no update check runs at startup."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está marcado, Luna busca una versión más reciente de yt-dlp al "
"iniciar y ofrece descargarla. Cuando no está marcado, no se realiza ninguna "
"comprobación de actualización al inicio."

#. Translators: Help text for the button that fetches the extra programs YouTube downloads need. "yt-dlp" is
#. a program name and is not translated.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:173
msgid ""
"Fetches yt-dlp and the JavaScript runtime it needs. YouTube playback and "
"downloads do not work until these are installed."
msgstr ""
"Descarga yt-dlp y el entorno de ejecución de JavaScript necesario. La "
"reproducción y descarga de YouTube no funcionarán hasta que estén instalados."

#. Translators: Help text for the box holding the cookie file yt-dlp will use.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:176
msgid ""
"The cookie file, in Netscape format, that YouTube requests are sent with. "
"Use it for age-restricted or members-only videos. Choosing a file turns off "
"reading cookies from Firefox."
msgstr ""
"El archivo de cookies, en formato Netscape, con el que se envían las "
"solicitudes de YouTube. Úsalo para vídeos con restricción de edad o "
"exclusivos para miembros. Seleccionar un archivo desactiva la lectura de "
"cookies desde Firefox."

#. Translators: Help text for the button that picks a cookie file by hand.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:179
msgid ""
"Opens a file picker to choose a cookie file saved from your browser. This "
"turns off reading cookies from Firefox."
msgstr ""
"Abre un explorador de archivos para elegir un archivo de cookies guardado "
"desde tu navegador. Esto desactiva la lectura de cookies desde Firefox."

#. Translators: Help text for the button that switches to reading cookies from Firefox. "Firefox" is a
#. program name and is not translated.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:183
msgid ""
"Reads cookies straight from Firefox each time, always up to date, with no "
"file to keep. This clears any cookie file you chose. Firefox must be "
"installed and signed in to YouTube."
msgstr ""
"Lee las cookies directamente desde Firefox cada vez, siempre actualizadas y "
"sin necesidad de conservar un archivo. Esto borra cualquier archivo de "
"cookies que hayas elegido. Firefox debe estar instalado y con la sesión "
"iniciada en YouTube."

#. Translators: Help text for the read-only box that reports which cookie source is in use.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:186
msgid ""
"Reports whether YouTube requests currently use Firefox cookies, a cookie "
"file, or no cookies at all."
msgstr ""
"Informa si las solicitudes de YouTube utilizan actualmente cookies de "
"Firefox, un archivo de cookies o ninguna cookie."

#. Translators: File type name in the cookie-file picker on the general YouTube settings page.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:194
msgid "Cookie files"
msgstr "Archivos de cookies"

#. Translators: Cookie status: Luna is reading cookies straight from Firefox. "Firefox" is a program
#. name and is not translated.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:226
msgid "Using Firefox cookies"
msgstr "Usando cookies de Firefox"

#. Translators: Cookie status naming the file in use. {path} is a file path.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:229
msgid "Using cookie file: {path}"
msgstr "Usando archivo de cookies: {path}"

#. Translators: Cookie status: no cookies are sent with YouTube requests.
#: UI/YouTube/GeneralPreferences.cs:231
msgid "No cookies"
msgstr "Sin cookies"

#. Translators: Message shown when a YouTube address names a video and a playlist at the same time,
#. asking which of the two the user wants.
#: UI/YouTube/LinkKindDialog.cs:25
msgid ""
"This address points to one video and also includes a playlist. Choose which "
"content Luna should open."
msgstr ""
"Esta dirección apunta a un video y también incluye una lista de "
"reproducción. Elige qué contenido debe abrir Luna."

#. Translators: Quality choice that takes the best the video offers, with no cap.
#: UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:11 UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:24
msgid "Best quality"
msgstr "Mejor calidad"

#. Translators: Quality choice that takes the smallest/lowest the video offers.
#: UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:13 UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:26
msgid "Worst quality"
msgstr "Menor calidad"

#. Translators: Description of the 144p video quality.
#: UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:28
msgid "144p (very low quality)"
msgstr "144p (calidad muy baja)"

#. Translators: Description of the 240p video quality.
#: UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:30
msgid "240p (low quality)"
msgstr "240p (calidad baja)"

#. Translators: Description of the 360p video quality.
#: UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:32
msgid "360p (medium quality)"
msgstr "360p (calidad media)"

#. Translators: Description of the 480p video quality.
#: UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:34
msgid "480p (medium quality)"
msgstr "480p (calidad media)"

#. Translators: Description of the 720p video quality (high definition).
#: UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:36
msgid "720p (HD)"
msgstr "720p (HD)"

#. Translators: Description of the 1080p video quality (full high definition).
#: UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:38
msgid "1080p (Full HD)"
msgstr "1080p (Full HD)"

#. Translators: Description of the 1440p video quality (2K).
#: UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:40
msgid "1440p (2K)"
msgstr "1440p (2K)"

#. Translators: Description of the 2160p video quality (4K).
#: UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:42
msgid "2160p (4K)"
msgstr "2160p (4K)"

#. Translators: A video quality with no set description. {height} is a number of pixels.
#: UI/YouTube/QualityLabels.cs:44
msgid "{height}p"
msgstr "{height}p"

#. Translators: Button that plays only the sound of the video chosen in the list, with no picture.
#: UI/YouTube/ResultsDialog.cs:199
msgid "Play as audio"
msgstr "Reproducir como audio"

#. Translators: Names who published a result. {author} is a channel name.
#. Translators: Names who published a video result. {author} is a channel name.
#: UI/YouTube/ResultsDialog.cs:347 UI/YouTube/ResultsDialog.cs:366
msgid "by {author}"
msgstr "de {author}"

#. Translators: How many videos a playlist holds. {count} is a number.
#. Translators: How many videos a channel holds. {count} is a number.
#: UI/YouTube/ResultsDialog.cs:350 UI/YouTube/ResultsDialog.cs:359
msgid "contains {count} videos"
msgstr "contiene {count} vídeos"

#. Translators: Marks a row in the results list as a channel rather than a single video.
#. Translators: Heading above a YouTube channel's browser when the channel's name is not known.
#: UI/YouTube/ResultsDialog.cs:354 YouTube/Playback/Session.cs:93
msgid "Channel"
msgstr "Canal"

#. Translators: Context menu item in the results list that copies the address of the chosen video.
#: UI/YouTube/ResultsDialog.cs:386
#| msgid "Copy video link"
msgid "Copy link"
msgstr "Copiar enlace"

#. Translators: Context menu item in the results list that shows the chosen video in the web browser.
#: UI/YouTube/ResultsDialog.cs:388
msgid "Open in browser"
msgstr "Abrir en el navegador"

#. Translators: Label of the box where the user types what to search YouTube for.
#: UI/YouTube/SearchDialog.cs:53
msgid "Search for"
msgstr "Buscar"

#. Translators: Label of the list of search suggestions that appears as the user types.
#: UI/YouTube/SearchDialog.cs:57
msgid "Suggestions"
msgstr "Sugerencias"

#. Translators: Label of the list that narrows a YouTube search to one kind of result.
#: UI/YouTube/SearchDialog.cs:63
msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Filtro"

#. Translators: Search filter: return results of every kind, unfiltered.
#: UI/YouTube/SearchDialog.cs:66
msgid "No filter"
msgstr "Sin filtro"

#. Translators: Search filter: order results by when they were uploaded, newest first.
#: UI/YouTube/SearchDialog.cs:70
msgid "Upload date"
msgstr "Fecha de subida"

#. Translators: Search filter: order results by how many times they have been viewed.
#: UI/YouTube/SearchDialog.cs:72
msgid "View count"
msgstr "Número de visualizaciones"

#. Translators: A channel browser tab: the channel's ordinary videos.
#. Translators: Title of the window listing the videos a search or a playlist turned up.
#: YouTube/Client/Channels.cs:30 YouTube/Playback/Sessions.cs:259
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "Videos"

#. Translators: A channel browser tab: the channel's short vertical videos.
#: YouTube/Client/Channels.cs:32
msgid "Shorts"
msgstr "Shorts"

#. Translators: A channel browser tab: the channel's live streams and their recordings.
#: YouTube/Client/Channels.cs:34
msgid "Streams"
msgstr "Transmisiones en directo"

#. Translators: A channel browser tab: the channel's community posts.
#: YouTube/Client/Channels.cs:38
msgid "Community"
msgstr "Comunidad"

#. Translators: Shown when the extra programs YouTube's yt-dlp support needs are already there.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:93
msgid "YouTube components are already installed."
msgstr "Los componentes de YouTube ya están instalados."

#. Translators: Title of the window shown while the extra programs for yt-dlp are being fetched.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:101
msgid "Downloading YouTube components"
msgstr "Descargando componentes de YouTube"

#. Translators: First message shown while the extra programs for yt-dlp are being fetched.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:103
msgid "Contacting the download site..."
msgstr "Contactando con el sitio de descarga..."

#. Translators: Progress heading while an extra program is being fetched. {name} is the
#. program and its version, {step} which one it is and {total} how many there are.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:108
msgid "Downloading {name}, {step} of {total}"
msgstr "Descargando {name}, {step} de {total}"

#. Translators: Shown once the extra programs for yt-dlp have been fetched.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:119
msgid "YouTube components were downloaded successfully."
msgstr "Los componentes de YouTube se descargaron con éxito."

#. Translators: Shown when the extra programs needed for YouTube playback could not be installed.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:124
msgid "Could not install YouTube components."
msgstr "No se pudieron instalar los componentes de YouTube."

#. Translators: Shown when the user asks to update yt-dlp and it has not been installed.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:149
msgid "yt-dlp is not installed yet."
msgstr "yt-dlp aún no está instalado."

#. Translators: Spoken when the user asks to update yt-dlp.
#. Translators: The short wording spoken when the user asks to update yt-dlp.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:155 YouTube/Components/Service.cs:157
msgid "Updating yt-dlp..."
msgstr "Actualizando yt-dlp..."

#. Translators: Title of the window shown while yt-dlp is updating itself.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:160
msgid "Updating yt-dlp"
msgstr "Actualización de yt-dlp"

#. Translators: First message shown while yt-dlp is updating itself.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:162
msgid "Checking current yt-dlp version..."
msgstr "Comprobando la versión actual de yt-dlp..."

#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:211
msgid ""
"A newer yt-dlp version is available on the '{channel}' channel.\n"
"Current version: {current}\n"
"Latest version: {latest}\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to update now?"
msgstr ""
"Hay una nueva versión de yt-dlp disponible en el canal '{channel}'.\n"
"Versión actual: {current}\n"
"Última versión: {latest}\n"
"\n"
"¿Deseas actualizar ahora?"

#. Translators: Shown when yt-dlp could not update itself and said nothing useful about why.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:269
msgid "Could not update yt-dlp."
msgstr "No se pudo actualizar yt-dlp."

#. Translators: Shown once yt-dlp has updated itself. {old} and {new} are version numbers and
#. {channel} is the release line being followed.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:279
msgid "yt-dlp updated from {old} to {new} on the '{channel}' channel."
msgstr "yt-dlp se actualizó de {old} a {new} en el canal '{channel}'."

#. Translators: Shown when yt-dlp was already the newest build. {version} is its version number
#. and {channel} is the release line being followed.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:285
msgid "yt-dlp is already up to date ({version}) on the '{channel}' channel."
msgstr "yt-dlp ya está actualizado ({version}) en el canal '{channel}'."

#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:302
msgid ""
"Total size: {total}\n"
"Downloaded: {got}\n"
"Percentage: {percent}%"
msgstr ""
"Tamaño total: {total}\n"
"Descargado: {got}\n"
"Porcentaje: {percent}%"

#. Translators: Title of the messages shown about the extra programs YouTube's yt-dlp support needs.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:333
msgid "YouTube components"
msgstr "Componentes de YouTube"

#. Translators: Title of the messages shown about updating yt-dlp. "yt-dlp" is a program name and is
#. not translated.
#: YouTube/Components/Service.cs:338
msgid "yt-dlp update"
msgstr "Actualización de yt-dlp"

#. Translators: Message shown while the first video of a search is being made ready to play.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:55
msgid "Fetching first stream..."
msgstr "Obteniendo la primera transmisión..."

#. Translators: Title of the window shown while a YouTube search is running.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:58
msgid "Searching YouTube"
msgstr "Buscando en YouTube"

#. Translators: First message shown while a YouTube search is running.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:60
msgid "Searching videos..."
msgstr "Buscando videos..."

#. Translators: Shown when a YouTube search failed and nothing said why.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:72
msgid "Could not complete YouTube search."
msgstr "No se pudo completar la búsqueda en YouTube."

#. Translators: Shown when a YouTube search found nothing at all.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:79
msgid "No videos were found for this search."
msgstr "No se encontraron videos para esta búsqueda."

#. Translators: Shown when an address looked like a YouTube link but names no playlist.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:93
msgid "This link does not include a YouTube playlist."
msgstr "Este enlace no incluye una lista de reproducción de YouTube."

#. Translators: Title of the window shown while a YouTube playlist is being read.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:100
msgid "Loading YouTube link"
msgstr "Cargando enlace de YouTube"

#. Translators: First message shown while the videos in a YouTube playlist are being listed.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:102
msgid "Loading playlist items..."
msgstr "Cargando elementos de la lista de reproducción..."

#. Translators: Shown when a YouTube address could not be read and nothing said why.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:114
msgid "Could not read YouTube link data."
msgstr "No se pudieron leer los datos del enlace de YouTube."

#. Translators: Shown when a YouTube playlist address opened nothing playable.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:121
msgid "No videos were found in this playlist."
msgstr "No se encontraron videos en esta lista de reproducción."

#. Translators: Title of the window shown while a YouTube channel is being opened.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:144
msgid "Loading channel"
msgstr "Cargando canal"

#. Translators: First message shown while a YouTube channel is being opened.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:146
msgid "Loading channel videos..."
msgstr "Cargando vídeos del canal..."

#. Translators: Shown when a YouTube channel could not be read.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:158
msgid "Could not read this YouTube channel."
msgstr "No se pudo leer este canal de YouTube."

#. Translators: Spoken when a video could not be removed from the favourites.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:185
msgid "Could not remove from favorites."
msgstr "No se pudo eliminar de favoritos."

#. Translators: Spoken when a video could not be added to the favourites.
#: YouTube/Playback/Browsing.cs:202
msgid "Could not add to favorites."
msgstr "No se pudo añadir a favoritos."

#. Translators: Spoken when a playlist or channel row is used with a video-only queue command.
#: YouTube/Playback/Feed.cs:73
msgid "Only videos can be added to the download queue."
msgstr "Solo se pueden añadir vídeos a la cola de descargas."

#. Translators: Short wording for a non-video row used with the download queue.
#: YouTube/Playback/Feed.cs:75
msgid "Not a video."
msgstr "No es un vídeo."

#. Translators: Spoken when the user reaches the end of the results list and more are being fetched.
#. Translators: The short wording spoken while more search results are being fetched.
#: YouTube/Playback/Feed.cs:115 YouTube/Playback/Feed.cs:117
msgid "Loading more videos..."
msgstr "Cargando más videos..."

#. Translators: Shown when a video was found but the player could not start playing it.
#: YouTube/Playback/Playing.cs:75
msgid "Could not open YouTube stream."
msgstr "No se pudo abrir la transmisión de YouTube."

#. Translators: Spoken when the video before this one is being fetched before it can be played.
#. Translators: The short wording spoken while the video before this one is being fetched.
#: YouTube/Playback/Playing.cs:96 YouTube/Playback/Playing.cs:101
msgid "Loading previous video..."
msgstr "Cargando vídeo anterior..."

#. Translators: Spoken when the video after this one is being fetched before it can be played.
#. Translators: The short wording spoken while the video after this one is being fetched.
#: YouTube/Playback/Playing.cs:98 YouTube/Playback/Playing.cs:103
msgid "Loading next video..."
msgstr "Cargando el siguiente video..."

#. Translators: Spoken when the video before this one could not be fetched.
#: YouTube/Playback/Playing.cs:143
msgid "Could not load the previous video."
msgstr "No se pudo cargar el vídeo anterior."

#. Translators: Spoken when the video after this one could not be fetched, so playback stops.
#: YouTube/Playback/Playing.cs:145
msgid "Could not load the next video."
msgstr "No se pudo cargar el siguiente video."

#. Translators: The short wording spoken when the previous video could not be fetched.
#: YouTube/Playback/Playing.cs:148
msgid "Previous video failed."
msgstr "Fallo en el vídeo anterior."

#. Translators: The short wording spoken when the next video could not be fetched.
#: YouTube/Playback/Playing.cs:150
msgid "Next video failed."
msgstr "Fallo en el siguiente video."

#. Translators: Heading above the list of videos in a YouTube playlist.
#: YouTube/Playback/Session.cs:95
msgid "Playlist videos"
msgstr "Videos de la lista de reproducción"

#. Translators: Shown when an address looked like a YouTube link but names no video.
#: YouTube/Playback/Sessions.cs:140
msgid "This link does not include a YouTube video."
msgstr "Este enlace no incluye un video de YouTube."

#. Translators: Title of the window shown while the address of a video is being looked up.
#: YouTube/Playback/Sessions.cs:349
msgid "Loading YouTube stream"
msgstr "Cargando transmisión de YouTube"

#. Translators: First message shown while the address of a video is being looked up.
#: YouTube/Playback/Sessions.cs:351
msgid "Fetching stream URL..."
msgstr "Obteniendo URL de la transmisión..."

#. Translators: Shown when a video is private, deleted, or never existed.
#: YouTube/Utils.cs:153
msgid "This video is not available."
msgstr "Este video no está disponible."

#. Translators: Shown when YouTube has the video but will not serve it - age restricted, blocked
#. in this country, or paid for.
#: YouTube/Utils.cs:156
msgid "YouTube will not play this video here."
msgstr "YouTube no reproducirá este video aquí."

#. Translators: Shown when a video exists but offers nothing the player can play.
#: YouTube/Utils.cs:158
msgid "Could not resolve a playable stream."
msgstr "No se pudo obtener una transmisión para reproducir."

#. Translators: Shown when the programs YouTube playback needs are not installed. "yt-dlp" is a
#. program name and is not translated.
#: YouTube/Utils.cs:161
msgid ""
"YouTube components are missing. Download them from the YouTube settings to "
"play or download videos."
msgstr ""
"Faltan componentes de YouTube. Descárgalos desde los ajustes de YouTube para "
"reproducir o descargar vídeos."

#. Translators: Shown when YouTube is refusing requests from this computer for the time being.
#. "HTTP 429" is the numbered error it answers with and is not translated.
#: YouTube/Utils.cs:164
msgid ""
"YouTube returned HTTP 429 (Too Many Requests). Your IP may be temporarily "
"rate-limited."
msgstr ""
"YouTube devolvió el error HTTP 429 (Demasiadas solicitudes). Tu dirección IP "
"podría estar restringida temporalmente."

#. Translators: Shown when the request never reached YouTube or its answer never arrived.
#: YouTube/Utils.cs:166
msgid "Could not reach YouTube. Check the network connection."
msgstr "No se pudo conectar con YouTube. Comprueba la conexión a Internet."

#. Translators: Shown when something went wrong that the player cannot explain more precisely.
#: YouTube/Utils.cs:170
msgid "Could not read this video."
msgstr "No se pudo leer este video."

#. Translators: Adds the technical reason under a message about YouTube. {message} is that
#. message and {details} is the reason, which is not translated.
#: YouTube/Utils.cs:176
msgid ""
"{message}\n"
"Details: {details}"
msgstr ""
"{message}\n"
"Detalles: {details}"

#. Translators: Shown when a video could not be turned into something playable and nothing said why.
#: YouTube/Utils.cs:191
msgid "Could not resolve YouTube stream."
msgstr "No se pudo obtener la transmisión de YouTube."

